title: Proxmox Mail Gateway: Spam Quarantine Statistics
agents: pmg
catalog: app/pmg
license: GPLv2
distribution: check_mk
description:
 Monitors the size (mail count and estimated disk usage) of the spam
 quarantine via {/quarantine/spamstatus}, plus the average spam score
 of quarantined mail. Useful to catch unusually large quarantine
 growth (spam wave, or users no longer reviewing/releasing quarantined
 mail) and disk-space pressure from quarantine storage.

 Note: {/quarantine/spamstatus} reports the full quarantine database,
 not a recent time window -- for the current backlog that still needs
 to be released or deleted, see {PMG Spam Quarantine Queue} instead.

 Optional WARN/CRIT thresholds apply to the mail count.

item:
 None, one service per host.

discovery:
 One service is created if spam quarantine status is available from
 the API.
